    "settleNote": "POST /restart answers 200 success:true, but /status settles on running:false: the killed child's close handler clears runningProcess after /restart assigned the replacement (server.js:459-470), and POST /stop then returns success:false while the replacement may still be running. The deferred SIGKILL at server.js:437-445 reads the same module-level variable, so the replacement surviving is a race - the counts below differ between runs and are compared through the restart-settle shape rule."
